  },
  {
   "app": "babbel",
   "score": 5,
   "content": "Coming from Duolingo and Rosetta Stone, this one is head and shoulder above. Also just found out that the phone version of the app has extensive features - it makes the app from the better to the BEST - under \"Practice,\" while only its sub-section \"Review\" is available in the tab"
  },
  {
   "app": "busuu",
   "score": 5,
